# `VERSION` (repo root) — build-version marker for the web app's profile
# menu (EVT-34). `export-subst` makes `git archive` (deploy.sh's packaging
# step) substitute the `$Format:...$` placeholder below with the archived
# commit's short SHA + committer date. A plain `git checkout`/clone (local
# dev, `vite dev`, dev-compose bind mount) NEVER substitutes it — the file
# keeps the literal placeholder text — which is exactly how
# apps/web/vite-config/build-version.ts tells a real deploy build apart
# from a dev build and falls back to the `dev` marker.
VERSION export-subst
